        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-53928\"><b>Laurey 53928, Kensington Cabinet Knob in Satin Nickel</b></a>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Kensington Satin Nickel Knob is a simple knob that is well-suited for many applications. Its classic design makes it ideal for traditional kitchens as well as industrial home decor. The Kensington Cabinet Knob in Satin Nickel is a standard sized kitchen cabinet knob with a 1-3/8 inch diameter and a 1 inch projection.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis transitional cabinet knob is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=Laurey+Kensington\">Laurey Kensington Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey 53928 1-3/8\" Knob Kensington Satin Nickel:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Nickel</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screw and 1-1/2\" long #8-32 screw.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available finishes:</b>\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"#LAU-53928\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-53928-SM.jpg?v=1704354623\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU-53928\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/kensington-oil-rubbed-bronze-knob-laurey-53966\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-53966-SM.jpg?v=1704354623\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU-53966\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/kensington-polished-nickel-knob-laurey-53914\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-53914-SM.jpg?v=1704354623\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU-53914\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/kensington-satin-brass-knob-laurey-53904\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-53904-SM.jpg?v=1704354624\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU-53904\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n</tr>\r